    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok thanks. i'll try bumping the memory limits. but just to be safe, i want to make sure i'm not missing anything else that could cause this kind of cycle. are there any other subtle config errors or environment issues that might look like an OOM error but aren't actually about the raw amount of RAM? like something in the yaml or the node setup?",
