    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'll check the kubelet and sysctl stuff. one more thing—is it possible for this to be caused by some external sidecar or a background process on the node just randomly eating up all the resources? like, how do i track down if it's specifically my app or just something else in the cluster messing with it?",
